{% endfor %}

**Analysis:** By selectively extracting hydrogen from the reaction lumen, localized $p_{\text{H}_2}$ drops, shifting the endothermic equilibrium forward according to Le Chatelier's principle. In the **Jiang 2021 Target** case (SMA $= 4.50\text{ cm}^2/\text{g}$ vs. $0.33\text{ cm}^2/\text{g}$ baseline), single-pass conversion increases by **{{ "%0.2f"|format(results_b['Jiang 2021 Target']['Gain_X']) }} percentage points** and recovers **{{ "%0.2f"|format(results_b['Jiang 2021 Target']['HRF']) }}%** of the generated hydrogen as high-purity permeate.

