3. **Pressure Driving Force**: Applying a $99\text{ bar}$ trans-membrane pressure differential pushes conversion to **{{ "%0.2f"|format(results_a['Best Case + dP 99 bar']['X_MR']) }}%** with **{{ "%0.2f"|format(results_a['Best Case + dP 99 bar']['Water_Removal']) }}%** water extraction.

